OL,3,GNEWSAWeed-choked river cleared allowing
OL,4,Aboats to pass
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the EA said: "We
OL,7,Funderstand people's love of this river
OL,8,Fand are working with our partners to
OL,9,Fremove the blockage and resolve the
OL,10,Fissue."
